/*
 * Implements semantic validation for constructors.
 *
 * This module handles:
 *   - prototype validation for constructors(with or without body),
 *   - validation of parameters, attributes, and throwers,
 *   - struct-constructor vs class-constructor dispatch,
 *   - template-mapper integration for instantiated constructors,
 *   - construction of CtorPrototypeValue entries,
 *   - enforcement of classRef context during validation.
 *
 * Constructor validation is split between:
 *   - StructCtorValidation  (value-type constructors)
 *   - ClassCtorValidation   (reference-type constructors)
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::symbol::function::ctor
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/symbol/function/ctor.yr
